        "description": "Upload a media asset (image or video) to Canva by providing a publicly accessible URL. Once uploaded, the asset can be used in designs. Poll the returned job ID to verify completion. Request body: Body: {name (required, 1–255 chars), url (required, 8–2048 chars, must be publicly accessible)}.",
